#org @gText_PkmnTower_Gengar
Garr!

#org @gText_PkmnTower_Gatekeeper
Hello worthy challenger.\nAbove are some trials that only the\lmost talented players could\lcomplete.\pThere may be a fine reward at the end.\nOr perhaps not.\pDo you wish to attempt this?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_Gatekeeper2
Very well challenger.\nFollow me.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_GateKeeperReject
Alright then.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_GateKeeperRules
[BLUE]Your Start menu and other functions\nhave been disabled. So, you won't\lbe able to heal.\pThere are [GREEN]Gengars[BLUE] guarding this\narea that will send you back to the\lentrance if you get caught by them.\pAnd[.]other possible foes[.]\pI'll be here if you want me to\nescort you out.\pBest of luck.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_1
[BLUE]It seems you've gotten past the fear-\nsome obstacles[.]\pI've been tasked to guard this\narea, and I intend to do it well.\pSo, trainer, are you ready to\nbattle?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_2
[BLUE]Let us begin.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_3
Hmm[.] Well played.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_4
[BLUE]You are extremely powerful,\nchallenger.\pI will need to return\nto my training[.]\pBefore I leave, as a courtesy, I can\nheal two of your Pok\emon.\pWould that interest you?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_5
[BLUE]Huh, how brave of you.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_6
[BLUE]Well then, best of luck on\nthe rest of your trial.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_4_2
[BLUE]Your [GREEN][BUFFER1][BLUE] has been healed.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_4_2 
[RED]Your [GREEN][BUFFER1][RED] has been healed.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer1_4_3
[BLUE]Would you like another Pok\emon to be\nhealed?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_1
[RED]I don't like wasting time.\pYou know the deal.\nAre you ready to fight?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_2
[RED]Very well, let's have at it.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_3
Mm[.] perhaps I was overconfident. 

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_4
[RED]Well, like the trainer who preceded\nme, I can heal 2 of your Pok\emon.\pAre you in need of this service?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_4_3
[RED]Another one?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_5
Hmm[.] strange.\nNo one has denied this service\lbefore.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer2_6
Well, this is goodbye.\nI'm not aware of the foe we're\lcharged with protecting, but I hope\lyou're able to leverage its power\lfor good.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer3_1
[BLUE]It is rare for someone to make it this\nfar.\pFine, will you continue onwards?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer3_2
[BLUE]Let's hope this was no fluke, trainer.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer3_3
Well, I did my best.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer3_4
[BLUE]It was not by chance that you've\nmade it this far. Congratulations.\pThere is only one more foe ahead.\pWould you like me to heal\ntwo Pok\emon?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer3_5
Not a fan of handouts?\nUnderstandable.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_AceTrainer3_6
Good luck.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_GateKeeperLeave
If you leave, all the progress you've\nmade will be reset, including trainers\ldefeated.\pWould you still like me to\nescort you out?

#org @gText_PkmnTower_Morty_1
[BLUE]Ah[.]\pI definitely expected you to be the\none to make it here,\l[GREEN][PLAYER][BLUE].

#org @gText_PkmnTower_Morty_2
[BLUE]It's quite strange. This Pok\emon\nseems quite harmless at first glance,\lsome could even call it cute.\pHowever, it's capable of copying and\nperfecting abilities it observes.\pCoupled with its capabilities of\ninflicting fear upon massive groups\lof people[.]\pPut it simply, it'll wreak\ngreat havoc in the wrong hands.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_Morty_3
[GREEN][PLAYER][BLUE], it's clear to me you only\nhave good intentions.\pPlease, show me your strength\none last time.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_Morty_4
[BLUE]With Team Rocket taken down, we\nmust do everything possible to uphold\lthe current status quo[.]\pSo these powerful Pok\emon showing up\nout of the blue leaves a lot of\lus concerned.\pBut, you ought to take pride of\nthe peace you created, [GREEN][PLAYER].[BLUE]\pPlease, have this.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_Morty_5
[BLUE]I'm sure many more powerful foes\nawait you.\pI wish you the best.

#org @gText_PkmnTower_MortyLoss
It was the expected outcome.\nThank you for the opportunity.